Problem: Group words by their starting character.
Constraints:

Words contain only letters

Case-sensitive grouping
Sample Input:
["Alice", "Arun", "Bob", "Bala", "Charlie"]
Sample Output:
A: [Alice, Arun]
B: [Bob, Bala]
C: [Charlie]
Approach:

Use Map<Character, List>

Use getOrDefault() or computeIfAbsent() to maintain groupings